  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>11</mn><mn>1011</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><msup><mn>11</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></mfenced><mn>327</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>9</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>327</mn></msup></math></p><p>when divided by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>9</mn></math>&nbsp;is equivalent to the division of&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>8</mn><mn>327</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>327</mn></msup></math></p><p>i.e. remainder<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math></p><p>Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mn>1011</mn></mfenced><mn>11</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>9</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>11</mn></msup></math></p><p>when divided by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>9</mn></math>&nbsp;is equivalent to the division of&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>11</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mn>9</mn></mfenced><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>i.e. remainder<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mn>11</mn><mn>1011</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>1011</mn><mn>11</mn></msup></math> has&nbsp;same remainder as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn></math>.</p>"
